  <text x="283" y="30" fill="var(--fg-1)" font-size="14">After</text>
  <text x="14" y="58" fill="var(--fg-2)">acrylic, 6% white</text>
  <text x="283" y="58" fill="var(--fg-2)">solid, the raised surface</text>
  <text x="14" y="82" fill="var(--fg-3)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11">--acrylic-bg</text>
  <text x="283" y="82" fill="var(--fg-3)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11">--bg-2</text>
</svg>
</figure>
<p>Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> to hide a record; <mark>nothing is written</mark>.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Surface</th><th>Today</th><th>Proposed</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td>Card</td><td>acrylic</td><td>solid</td></tr><tr><td>Record</td><td>pane</td><td>card</td></tr></tbody></table>
<details><summary>Evidence a reader may skip</summary><p>A details panel on the solid surface.</p></details>
